{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんにちはー！\n \n \n 今日はKEYABINGOの日です٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH695740DESYG6282D7D4WA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 今日はひらがなけやきの放送の日です！\n \n \n \n いっぱい#けやBINGOでツイートしてください！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6967YXKA6Q1WJE7DSXDPX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 今回はいっぱい踊っていっぱい汗をかいて頑張っています！！\n \n \n 見所たくさんなので見てください♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6978AN5N66FE3VKGACDZ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 最近はいっぱいテレビ出れて嬉しいなー！\n \n \n \n 毎日毎日恵まれた環境でお仕事させていただけてることに感謝して頑張りたいと思います！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6986F8D5KPKXYCS6E8JP8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 昨日スイーツパラダイスさんから差し入れのケーキをいただきました！！\n \n とーっても美味しかったです♡\n \n \n スイーツだいすきー٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6996MGTXWW4Y2K5YTJ86Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69A6P2GHRP9JV32Z16FHB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 最近、顔の肉がひどいので痩せなきゃだけど、やっぱりスイーツは我慢できない！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69B4QV7MQV93T3S55WDRX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 今度みーぱんと美味しいアイス食べに行きたいです！\n \n \n ダイエットしよーって約束したのに、さっそく２人とも今日の朝ごはんにアイスを食べてました（笑）\n \n \n だから青汁のもーって約束しました！\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69C32ZB0WQDA3KV3A8BXY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n みーぱんはスイーツ大好きだけどダイエットしてる仲間です！\n \n 夏は一緒に支えあいながらダイエット頑張りたいです！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69D53EQ017D9JDEAM5D40","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n そしてそして\n 昨日実は、ライブの前に富士急で\n ドドンパと富士山に乗らせてもらいました！\n \n スーーッゴイ楽しかったです！！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69E5HGF1RBT8A7KJH3A62","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n ジェットコースターに乗るのは\n けやかけのロケで高飛車に乗った時ぶりでした！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69F4RXSVAKY39JWSVH66Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69G3VQH1BYYDV48D3WAW1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69H1934Y2BJRA3TNWPADS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69HZFQYWG2SPFR55ZQTRP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n この写真の時ぶりでした！↑\n \n \n この時から時間が経つのはあっという間だな〜〜と思いました。\n \n \n ドドンパは人生初乗りました！\n \n 楽しかったー！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69JZNP2N7A6AA7SY7Y438","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n ゆうかちゃんと隣で乗りました！\n \n 安心感ありました（笑）\n \n \n すごくすごく楽しかったです！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69M05T13P5S8E7SSC9AN0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n そしてそして\n ホテルのお部屋は\n みーぱんとゆうかちゃんとでした！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69N2448QTZ7BVA14BVKDR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n とても居心地よくて落ち着きましたー！\n \n ドラマ見てたくさん笑いました（笑）\n \n 大好きな２人です！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH69P2MFMVFVCHMTVRKKYBC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n ライブも空き時間もホテルも\n とっても楽しい夏の思い出ができました！\n \n \n 最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"}],"source":"archive"}